<td id="Sx4.T3.1.6.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center"><span id="Sx4.T3.1.6.1.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_smallcaps">Jupiter</span> (w/o VM)</td>
<td id="Sx4.T3.1.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">26.7 (OR) / 13.3 (Vote)</td></tr>
